+- Task: `TASK-260830-21gygk`, Story: `STORY-260830-3tq4ns`.
+- Candidate source: `e119aaeede327580a470238fdb1ccf340a785b39`; Story checkpoint/base: `8626fb361c1d6b62d5f95c7be4cb33c85d4aadf3`.
